    "https://usccareers.usc.edu/job/los-angeles/clinical-assistant-professor-of-radology-interventional-radiologist-clinician-educator-chla/1209/60632242912": {
      "title": "Clinical Assistant Professor of Radology (Interventional Radiologist) (Clinician Educator) CHLA",
      "description": "Clinical Assistant Professor of Radology (Interventional Radiologist) (Clinician Educator) CHLA at USC Skip to main content Life at USC Career Areas Faculty Keck Medicine of USC Auxiliary Services Information Technology Services Human Resources, Ethics, and Compliance USC Advancement Current Employees Returning Applicants Saved Jobs 0 Job Alerts Join Our Trojan Community At USC, we are united by shared values and a bold vision for the future. Join a workplace where your role has meaning, your growth is supported, and your impact is felt across campus, Los Angeles, and the world. Search by Keyword Search Jobs Faculty Educators, mentors, and agents of change. As USC faculty, we are committed to advancing knowledge, inspiring students, and elevating research that fosters discovery and drives societal impact – all in service of our mission. Learn more on the We Are USC Faculty webpage Search Jobs Search by Keyword Location Radius Select Radius 5 miles 15 miles 25 miles 35 miles 50 miles Search Jobs Clinical Assistant Professor of Radology (Interventional Radiologist) (Clinician Educator) CHLA Los Angeles, CA Apply Save Job Current employees apply here Job ID REQ20124162 Category Faculty Helpful Information for Applicants External Applicants Internal Applicants (Current USC Employees) The University of Southern California (USC), founded in 1880, is the largest private employer in the City of Los Angeles. As an employee of USC, you will be a part of a world-class research university and a member of the \"Trojan Family,\" which is comprised of the faculty, students and staff that make the university what it is. The Department of Radiology at Children’s Hospital Los Angeles, affiliated with the USC Keck School of Medicine, is actively searching for a Pediatric Interventional Radiologist at the rank of Clinical Assistant Professor of Radiology (Clinician Educator) to join the faculty team. This full-time position will come with an appropriate faculty appointment based on candidate experience. Applicants will have an MD or MD/PhD degree(s) or equivalent, completed fellowship training in Adult Interventional Radiology (IR) and/or Pediatric Interventional Radiology, and ABR certification in Diagnostic Radiology with Certificate of Added Qualification (CAQ) eligible or certified in Pediatric Interventional Radiology. The ideal candidate will have a strong track record for both clinical and educational achievement in Pediatric Interventional Radiology. Research opportunities both within the department and across the institution are many and encouraged. CHLA is a 600-bed dedicated pediatric hospital affiliated with USC. CHLA has the full spectrum of pediatric subspecialties that service a large, diverse population of children in the greater Los Angeles and Southern California area. The Department of Radiology at CHLA is a 16-physician department performing 160,000 imaging studies per year. The department has 6 MRIs: two 1.5 Tesla, two 3 Tesla clinical instruments (a third being added this year), a research 3T clinical magnet, and an 11.7T Bruker research magnet. CT SPECT, CT PET, DEXA, and all other imaging modalities are also present. The department has an ACGME-accredited Pediatric Radiology fellowship program, a Pediatric Neuroradiology fellowship program, and rotating radiology residents from various academic institutions across Southern California. This position is a continuing appointment, non-tenure eligible. Academic appointment in the Department of Radiology, rank, and salary is commensurate with experience and qualifications. This is a full-time position for patient care, teaching, and research. Apply here and upload a cover letter, CV and 3 references. For further inquiries contact: Marvin D. Nelson, MD mdnelson@chla.usc.edu or 4650 Sunset Blvd., MS #81 Los Angeles, CA 90027 Founded in 1901, Children's Hospital Los Angeles is one of the nation's leading children's hospitals and is acknowledged worldwide for its leadership in pediatric and adolescent health. CHLA is the only children's hospital in California to make the prestigious U.S. News & World Report Honor Roll of \"Best\" children's hospitals, and is nationally ranked in all 10 pediatric specialties. Children's Hospital Los Angeles is a premier teaching hospital and has been affiliated with the Keck School of Medicine of the University of Southern California since 1932. Academic appointment through USC Keck School of Medicine is available at a level appropriate to training and experience. USC is an equal opportunity, affirmative action employer. CHLA and USC greatly values diversity and is committed to building a vibrant and culturally diverse community of faculty that best reflects the patients and families that we serve. Individuals from underrepresented groups in medicine are especially encouraged to apply. Job ID REQ20124162 Posted Date 07/25/2025 Apply Save Job Current employees apply here SHARE Facebook X LinkedIn Email Related Content Learn More August 04, 2025 USC Today Explore the latest stories of impact, innovation, and Trojan spirit shaping USC and the world beyond. Learn More July 28, 2025 USC News Blog - Hub Page Related Content Our Communities Rooted in LA, USC partners with local communities to uplift education, well-being, and opportunity across Southern California. Learn More July 28, 2025 Culture & Community Blog - Hub Page Related Content Mission Statement USC’s central mission is the development of human beings and society as a whole through the cultivation and enrichment of the human mind and spirit. Learn More July 28, 2025 Mission & Values Blog - Hub Page Related Content Alumni USC Today’s Alumni page highlights news, achievements, research and stories from USC alumni and the Trojan Family. Learn More August 03, 2026 Culture & Community Article Blog - Hub Page Related Content USC Football Stay connected with USC Football through the latest news, schedules, scores, highlights, and team updat